sually enhance existing word embeddings by training an autoencoder on pre-trained word embeddings and matching intermediate representations to visual features extracted from a convolutional network trained on ImageNet.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Object-Hypernym co-occurrences': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A specific type of co-occurrence calculated using ImageNet annotations augmented with WordNet hypernyms. It involves identifying the co-occurrences between objects and their hypernyms (more general terms).'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Object-Attribute co-occurrences': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ["A specific type of co-occurrence computed from VisualGenome's object and attribute annotations. It involves identifying the co-occurrences between objects and their attributes."], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'ELMo': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A contextualized word representation model used for pre-training.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'OpenAI GPT': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A language model used for pre-training contextualized word representations.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'BERT': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A contextualized word representation model used for pre-training.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Adagrad': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['An optimization algorithm reported to work best for GloVe.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Visual Genome': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for estimating visual co-occurrence counts.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'word embeddings': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The task of learning vector representations of words, capturing semantic relationships.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'clustering analysis': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The task of grouping similar data points together, used to analyze ViCo embeddings.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'ViCo Objective': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The objective of the ViCo method is to learn ViCo embeddings that represent similarities and differences between visual categories, which are hypothesized to be missing from GloVe.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'ViCo Loss Function': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The loss function used by ViCo, which is minimized to learn ViCo embeddings. The specific equation is provided in the text.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Weighting Function': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ["The function 'f : R → R' used in GloVe to assign lower weight to less frequent, noisy co-occurrences. In the provided text, it is set to the constant 1 for all X in the ViCo method."], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Co-occurrence Type-Specific Transformation Function': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ["The function 'φt : R d → R dt' used in ViCo, which maps ViCo embeddings to a type-specialized embedding space."], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Co-occurrence Types': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The different types of co-occurrences used in ViCo, including object-hypernym (oh), object-object (oa), and image-image (c) co-occurrences, which are used to capture different relationships between words and visual concepts.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Training Details': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Information about the training process, including the optimization algorithm (Adagrad) and the datasets used (Visual Genome and ImageNet) for estimating co-occurrence counts.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'CIFAR-100': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for evaluating object classification performance.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'ResNet': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A convolutional neural network used for feature extraction.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'MS-COCO': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for training word2vec.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'RefCOCO+': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for evaluating localization accuracy.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'zero-shot object classification': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The task of classifying objects without training on images of the unseen classes.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'object classification': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The task of assigning a label to an image based on its content.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'UNC split': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A specific split of the RefCOCO+ dataset used for evaluating localization accuracy.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'MAt-tNet': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['An open-source implementation used to compare localization accuracy with different embeddings on the RefCOCO+ dataset using the UNC split.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'GRU': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A Gated Recurrent Unit used to process word embeddings and fuse them with a question representation, which is then fed into an answer classifier.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'SVM': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A Support Vector Machine, a supervised machine learning model used for classification. In this context, it is used to learn a linear model over the scores calculated for GloVe and GloVe+ViCo models.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'Cosine Similarity': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A measure of similarity between two non-zero vectors of an inner product space that measures the cosine of the angle between them. It is used to compute the scores for GloVe and ViCo embeddings.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'word2vec': {'description': ['A word embedding model, similar to GloVe, typically learned from large-scale text corpora.', 'A method used for training word embeddings, specifically used for initialization of vis-w2v.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2]}}
